  <p>Final answer: <span set:html={rich('[[[\\boxed{P=30\\text{ units}}]]]')} /></p>
  <p>Verify: <span set:html={rich('[[5^2+12^2=13^2]]')} />, which is <span set:html={rich('[[25+144=169]].')} /> The equality confirms a valid right triangle.</p>

  <h3>Example 3: 8-15-17 Right Triangle</h3>
  <p>Given: <span set:html={rich('[[a=8,\\;b=15,\\;c=17]]')} /></p>
