  <p>Final answer: <span set:html={rich('[[[\\boxed{P=40\\text{ units}}]]]')} /></p>
  <p>Verify: <span set:html={rich('[[8^2+15^2=17^2]]')} />, which is <span set:html={rich('[[64+225=289]].')} /> Again the squares balance, confirming the right angle.</p>

